<title>USA: Pennzoil Caspian hires a president.</title>
<headline>Pennzoil Caspian hires a president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennzoil Co said Monday Igor Effimoff, formerly chief executive of Larmag Energy NV, has joined its Baku office as president of Pennzoil Caspian Corp.</p>
<p>Larmag, a privately held oil and gas company based in the Netherlands, operates producing fields in the Caspian Sea.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
